{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":130,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Cantique des degrés. Je t’ai invoqué des lieux profonds, ô Éternel !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Seigneur ! écoute ma voix ; que tes oreilles soient attentives à la voix de mes supplications.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ô Jah ! si tu prends garde aux iniquités, Seigneur, qui subsistera ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mais il y a pardon auprès de toi, afin que tu sois craint.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"J’ai attendu l’Éternel ; mon âme l’a attendu, et j’ai eu mon attente en sa parole.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mon âme [attend] le Seigneur, plus que les sentinelles [n’attendent] le matin, que les sentinelles [n’attendent] le matin.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Israël, attends-toi à l’Éternel ; car auprès de l’Éternel est la bonté, et il y a rédemption en abondance auprès de lui ;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Et lui rachètera Israël de toutes ses iniquités.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/130.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/131.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/129.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}